  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** 3 and 5\n\n**Given:**\n\n**3 × 45 ÷ 5 + 7 - 12 = 70**\n\n**After interchange the numbers;**\n\n**5 × *__45 ÷ 3__* + 7 - 12 = 70**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n***__5 × 15__***** + 7 - 12 = 70**\n\n***__75 + 7 __*****- 12 = 70**\n\n***__82 – 12__***** = 70**\n\n**70 = 70** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 :** 5 and 12\n\nGiven:\n\n3 × 45 ÷ 5 + 7 - 12 = 70\n\nAfter interchange the numbers;\n\n3 × ***__45 ÷ 12__*** + 7 - 5 = 70\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n***__3 × 3.75__*** + 7 - 5 = 70\n\n***__11.25 + 7__*** - 5 = 70\n\n***__18.25 – 5__*** = 70\n\n13.25 ≠ 70 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **5 and 7\n\nGiven:\n\n3 × 45 ÷ 5 + 7 - 12 = 70\n\nAfter interchange the numbers;\n\n3 × ***__45 ÷ 7__*** + 5 - 12 = 70\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n***__3 ×__****__ **6.42**__* + 5 - 12 = 70\n\n***__19.28 + 5__*** – 12 = 70\n\n***__24.28 – 12__*** = 70\n\n12.28 ≠ 70 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: **3 and 7\n\nGiven:\n\n3 × 45 ÷ 5 + 7 - 12 = 70\n\nAfter interchange the numbers;\n\n7 × ***__45 ÷ 5__*** + 3 - 12 = 70\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n***__7 × 9__*** + 3 - 12 = 70\n\n***__63 + 3__*** – 12 = 70\n\n66 – 12 = 70\n\n54 ≠ 70 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **“****3 and 5”.**",
